# Leave unset for local dev -- requests to /api/* go through the Vite dev server proxy
# (vite.config.ts) to the Worker at :8787, which keeps them same-origin so the session/CSRF
# cookies (SameSite=Lax) are sent. Only set this to point at a different, same-site Worker
# (e.g. a deployed one once a production custom domain exists).
# VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:8787
